4,"r1_spy":-0.083,"r5_spy":-0.1801,"r20_spy":-0.1898}}],"quotes":[{"c":"BURL 2018 Q2","e":"burl","d":"2018-08-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Marc Katz","x":"In addition, Standard and Poor's upgraded our secured debt rating to investment grade, BBB-, and raised the outlook on its BB corporate rating from stable to positive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/31/burlington-stores-inc-burl-q2-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"BURL 2018 Q3","e":"burl","d":"2018-11-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tom Kingsbury","x":"John, first, we only import directly five percent of our receipts, and clearly, not all of those receipts are in tariff impacted categories and not all are imported from China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/28/burlington-stores-inc-burl-q3-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"BURL 2018 Q3","e":"burl","d":"2018-11-28","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"John Kernan","x":"It seems like we're gonna get some type of announcement on tariffs fairly soon.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/28/burlington-stores-inc-burl-q3-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"BURL 2018 Q4","e":"burl","d":"2019-03-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kingsbury","x":"When combined with the continued success of our television campaigns and direct to consumer efforts, we see a multi-channel marketing strategy that will help us build our brand and drive traffic to our stores in 2019 and beyond.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/07/burlington-stores-inc-burl-q4-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"BURL 2018 Q4","e":"burl","d":"2019-03-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kingsbury","x":"Our short stay inventory increase is primarily driven by accelerating tariff impacted receipts prior to January 1st.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/07/burlington-stores-inc-burl-q4-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"BURL 2018 Q4","e":"burl","d":"2019-03-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Marc Katz","x":"As Tom discussed earlier in some detail, this higher than usual increase was a function of the very strong fourth quarter buying environment, as well as our decision to accelerate tariff impacted receipts prior to January 1st.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/07/burlington-stores-inc-burl-q4-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"BURL 2019 Q1","e":"burl","d":"2019-05-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kingsbury","x":"First, our recent CEO succession news; and second, how higher tariffs might impact our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/06/07/burlington-stores-inc-burl-q1-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"BURL 2019 Q1","e":"burl","d":"2019-05-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kingsbury","x":"Next, I'd like to briefly address tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/06/07/burlington-stores-inc-burl-q1-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"BURL 2019 Q1","e":"burl","d":"2019-05-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kingsbury","x":"Beginning in the second quarter and to a greater degree in the fall, we are planning to distort the growth of Missy sportswear, specifically casual and athletic category categories, while working to right size the career-oriented categories.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/06/07/burlington-stores-inc-burl-q1-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"BURL 2019 Q1","e":"burl","d":"2019-05-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Kingsbury","x":"However, in the short term, our goal is to stabilize the ladies apparel business by distorting the growth in the more casual Missy sportswear category such as active and better casual, while right sizing our career businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/06/07/burlington-stores-inc-burl-q1-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"BURL 2019 Q1","e":"burl","d":"2019-05-30","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Trussell","x":"And quick follow-up on merchandise margin, should we -- reiterated guidance for the full year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/06/07/burlington-stores-inc-burl-q1-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"BURL 2021 Q3","e":"burl","d":"2021-11-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John Crimmins","x":"In an inflation where -- inflationary situation, we'd certainly be able to raise prices, while continuing to maintain our value proposition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/23/burlington-stores-inc-burl-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"BURL 2021 Q3","e":"burl","d":"2021-11-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael O'Sullivan","x":"If it doesn't start to happen, it goes back to the comments that we had, this may be more of an inflationary environment, and there may be more room to take price than we've modeled.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/23/burlington-stores-inc-burl-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"BURL 2025 Q3","e":"burl","d":"2025-11-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael O'Sullivan","x":"It's worth calling out that this was despite the considerable headwind that we faced from tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/burlington-burl-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BURL 2025 Q3","e":"burl","d":"2025-11-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael O'Sullivan","x":"This is despite pressure from tariffs and is on top of 100 basis points of margin improvement in 2024.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/burlington-burl-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BURL 2025 Q3","e":"burl","d":"2025-11-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kristin Wolfe","x":"And then there are potential headwinds like tariff-driven price increases, which could put additional inflationary pressure on our core customer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/burlington-burl-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BURL 2025 Q3","e":"burl","d":"2025-11-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael O'Sullivan","x":"But we will not raise prices unless we've seen them go up elsewhere.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/burlington-burl-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BURL 2025 Q3","e":"burl","d":"2025-11-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kristin Wolfe","x":"This was primarily driven by leverage in supply chain, through continued cost savings and efficiency initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/burlington-burl-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BURL 2025 Q3","e":"burl","d":"2025-11-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kristin Wolfe","x":"This was due to greater efficiencies and cost savings initiatives, particularly in transportation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/burlington-burl-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BURL 2025 Q4","e":"burl","d":"2026-03-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kristin Wolfe","x":"Merchandise margin increased by 40 basis points despite the negative impact from tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/05/burlington-burl-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BURL 2025 Q4","e":"burl","d":"2026-03-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kristin Wolfe","x":"Going down the P&L, we are assuming relatively flat merchandise margin as we invest and reinvest any favorability from cycling tariffs to better support better brands, higher inventory levels in stores—all of this to drive sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/05/burlington-burl-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BURL 2025 Q4","e":"burl","d":"2026-03-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Brooke Siler Roach","x":"I will pass it on.","url":"https://www